rviz 1.14.26 - Windows (MSVC + RoboStack/conda-forge) build fixes
=================================================================
Derived from RoboStack's ros-noetic-rviz.patch
(https://github.com/RoboStack/ros-noetic, BSD-3-Clause), with changes:
  * Ogre plugin lookup: RVIZ_OGRE_PLUGIN_DIR -> CONDA_PREFIX -> compile-time
    path (no NULL dereference when CONDA_PREFIX is unset).
  * Removed Linux-only library path and debug message(WARNING) lines.
  * New CMake option RVIZ_BUILD_PYTHON_BINDINGS (default ON).

